// Step 1 of a two-step chain: read the org-unit fixture, roll each district's child count,
// and write newline-delimited JSON to a scratch file. Step 2 (`read-chain-2-reshape.d2ql`)
// reads that file back for further shaping. Run this first.
read("examples/d2ql/data/orgunits.json")
  | where level = 2
  | transform { id: id, name: name, districts: children.count() }
  | order name asc
  >> "/tmp/d2ql-districts.ndjson"
